   "en": "187 years after losing Earth...￥humanity found a new world.￥Elan, third planet of Tau Ceti.￥This world, so like Earth,￥became the only hope￥left to humankind.￥\"Project Elan\"￥Its goal: to place a jump￥wormhole, \"the Gate,\" in orbit￥around Elan for mass migration.￥To reach faraway Elan,￥construction began on a starship￥with a new kind of drive.￥It will hold a crew of only two.￥The ship is due in six months.￥Out of nine candidates,￥who will be chosen...?￥￥"
